# Your own personal layer. Never commit this: a precedent card names the failure,
# mechanism, and invariant of a project that may be under review.
profiles/private/
eval-results.tmp
*.log

# Applied personal profiles are user content. If you swap in your own profile,
# do not commit the slot files: run `scripts/use-profile.sh default` first.
# (CI warns when the slots differ from profiles/default, so an accidental commit
# is visible in the pull-request diff.)
